</table>
<p class="small">Smithery itself stays on this list as a directory: <a href={entry('smithery') || 'https://smithery.ai/'}>Smithery on Swarmnest</a>. Sponsorship never affects which tools appear here or their order.</p>

<h2 id="swarmnest">Find Replacements With Swarmnest</h2>
<p>Swarmnest keeps a hand-checked directory of <a href="/directory/mcp-servers/">MCP servers</a>, <a href="/directory/mcp-sdks-dev-tools/">MCP SDKs and developer tools</a> and <a href="/directory/ai-tool-directories/">MCP directories</a>, with pricing and auth details for each. To search it from inside your agent, add our free, read-only <a href="/mcp-server/">Swarmnest MCP server</a> at <code>https://swarmnest.ai/mcp</code> (no API key) and ask something like "find the official Linear MCP server".</p>

